## Third-party notices

The directory `vendor/wechat_agent_sdk/` contains a source snapshot of the
`wechat-agent-sdk` package (version 0.2.1, MIT license) authored by AIhubmix
(https://github.com/AIhubmix/wechat-agent-sdk). The snapshot is distributed
for convenience of offline installation and is NOT covered by the copyright
notice above; its copyright and license belong to the original author.

The directory `vendor/nssm/` contains pre-built binaries of NSSM (the
Non-Sucking Service Manager, version 2.24, https://nssm.cc), used to run
wechat-bridge as a Windows service. NSSM is public domain ("You may
unconditionally use it and/or its source code for any purpose you wish");
the binaries are distributed for convenience of Windows deployment and are
NOT covered by the copyright notice above.

The file `web/static/cities.json` contains administrative-division data
(provinces/cities/counties with pinyin names and coordinates) derived from
`xiangyuecn/AreaCity-JsSpider-StatsGov` (https://github.com/xiangyuecn/AreaCity-JsSpider-StatsGov,
MIT license, data as of 2026-04-03, sourced from official statistics).
The data is distributed under its MIT license and is NOT covered by the
copyright notice above.